{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13254","headline":"送袁郎中破贼北归 · 皇甫冉","name":"送袁郎中破贼北归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"优诏亲贤时独稀，中途紫绂（一作「绶」）换征衣。\n黄香省闼登朝去，杨仆楼船振旅归。\n万里长闻随战角，十年不得掩（一作「偃」）郊扉。\n囗囗囗囗囗囗囗，但将词赋奉恩辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13254.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13254","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}